{
  "title": "从勾股定理到傅里叶",
  "theme": "lumen",
  "aspect": "16:9",
  "meta": { "description": "公式书写与推导、几何作图、函数与积分面积、傅里叶级数、物理模拟" },
  "style": { "energy": 0.5, "captions": true },
  "scenes": [
    { "layout": "cover", "blocks": [{ "type": "title", "kicker": "数学之美 · 第 1 讲", "text": "从勾股定理到傅里叶", "subtitle": "用动画看懂三个改变世界的想法" }], "narration": "今天用三个想法，走一遍两千五百年的数学。" },
    {
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "一个直角三角形" },
        { "type": "geometry", "points": { "A": [0, 0], "B": [4, 0], "C": [0, 3] }, "shapes": [{ "type": "polygon", "points": ["A", "B", "C"] }, { "type": "right-angle", "at": "A", "from": "B", "to": "C" }, { "type": "label", "between": ["A", "B"], "text": "a = 4" }, { "type": "label", "between": ["A", "C"], "text": "b = 3" }, { "type": "label", "between": ["B", "C"], "text": "c = ?" }] }
      ],
      "narration": "两条直角边分别是 4 和 3，斜边是多少？"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "勾股定理" },
        { "type": "equation", "latex": "a^2 + b^2 = c^2", "steps": ["4^2 + 3^2 = c^2", "16 + 9 = c^2", "c = \\sqrt{25} = 5"], "label": "两直角边的平方和，等于斜边的平方" }
      ],
      "narration": "代入计算，斜边等于 5。"
    },
    {
      "layout": "focus",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "曲线下的面积" },
        { "type": "plot", "functions": [{ "expr": "0.5*x^2", "label": "f(x)=\\tfrac{1}{2}x^2" }], "x": [-0.5, 3.2], "y": [-0.3, 5], "area": { "expr": "0.5*x^2", "from": 0, "to": 2.5, "label": "\\int_0^{2.5} f(x)\\,dx" }, "tangent": { "expr": "0.5*x^2", "from": 0.4, "to": 2.8 } }
      ],
      "narration": "积分就是把曲线下的面积切成无数细条再加起来。"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "微积分基本定理" },
        { "type": "equation", "latex": "\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b) - F(a)", "label": "求面积，只需要找到原函数" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "layout": "focus",
      "tone": "inverse",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "任何形状，都是圆的叠加" },
        { "type": "fourier", "shape": "heart", "terms": 60 }
      ],
      "narration": "傅里叶告诉我们：再复杂的曲线，也能由一圈圈旋转的圆合成。"
    },
    {
      "layout": "split",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "确定的方程，不可预测的运动", "subtitle": "双摆：初始条件的微小差别会被迅速放大" },
        { "type": "simulation", "preset": "double-pendulum" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "title", "text": "小结" },
        { "type": "bullets", "style": "checks", "items": ["勾股定理连接了长度与面积", "积分把无限细分变成可计算", "傅里叶把复杂拆成简单的叠加"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
